#N canvas 0 0 620 440 10;
#X text 60 30 instr — tracker instrument (standalone);
#X text 60 52 one instrument = a bank of pd arrays + a keymap + a volume;
#X text 60 70 envelope (sustain/loop) + key-off fadeout + voices (mono;
#X text 60 88 per tracker channel). Samples are referenced LIVE from pd;
#X text 60 106 arrays — nothing touches the filesystem;
#X text 60 140 setup:;
#X text 90 158 smp <idx> <array> [base] [loop] [ls] [le] — bind array;
#X text 90 176 keymap <ins> <from> <to> <smp> — note range to sample;
#X text 90 194 envpt <ins> <x> <y> / envcfg <ins> <envon> <sus> <la>;
#X text 90 212 <lb> <fadeout> — envelope from [modseq] arrays message;
#X text 60 246 playing:;
#X text 90 264 note <ch> <ins> <midi> <gain> — tracker form ([modseq] wire);
#X text 90 282 float / note <midi> [gain] — plain form — plays any note;
#X text 90 300 off / off <ch> <ins> — release;
#X text 90 318 pitch <ch> <ins> <semis> — live pitch offset (vib/porta);
#X text 90 336 vol <ch> <ins> <gain> — live volume (slides/tremolo);
#X text 90 354 bang — advance the envelope one song tick (wire [modseq]'s);
#X text 90 372 tick outlet here);
#X obj 480 60 instr 1;
